        },
        {
          "text": "Na wudumiki ghwawo ghose andenyi ya Hema ekwania ghuchakaia ni kuduka vilambo ivi: fremu ra Hema, mbau raro, nguro na vishawalata va nandonyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
